;==============================================================================
; GSD file for the DEMO-IO 16 (fictional modular remote I/O, test fixture).
; Written in the layout vendors use: CRLF line ends, aligned keywords,
; comments, a continuation line, PrmText/ExtUserPrmData blocks and modules.
;==============================================================================
#Profibus_DP

; --- Unit definition list ----------------------------------------------------
